he holds paragraph, or drop it.\n- Explain 639 vs 641.\n- Move the coupling-bound and surrogate standalone numbers out of the Model section into Results, or point to them.\n- Cut the abstract to about 10 numbers and remove repeats in the Claims paragraph.\n- Replace \"reaches the same\", \"equals\", \"ahead of\" and \"sits at a fit-noise floor\" with intervals or \"consistent with\".\n\n(8) Format: give the chord's r/a (needs the EFIT request) and decide the target venue's format (FED elsarticle). Fill the data statement: author only, do not fabricate.\n\n(9) Mirror all of the above into main_short_ko.tex."
